  <item>
    <title>【18】一些稀奇古怪的餐厅推荐</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66bb7b0133591c27bed99c99</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66bb7b0133591c27bed99c99</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 14 Aug 2024 12:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>今天四个人很没有营养的聊一聊大家的餐馆清单，以及九斤老太范式一般的结论：现在的餐馆都不行，不如以前</span></p><span></span><p><span>最后拉踩了下大学美食荒漠-交大</span></p><span></span><p><span>以下是大家的餐馆清单</span></p><span></span><p><span>王胖：</span></p><span></span><p><span>H2</span></p><span></span><p><span>顺风大酒店</span></p><span></span><p><span>松鹤楼</span></p><span></span><p><span>起劲：</span></p><span></span><p><span>佬米舍岛</span></p><span></span><p><span>摸头姐姐：</span></p><span></span><p><span>不入川豆花馆</span></p><span></span><p><span>竹屋川菜</span></p><span></span><p><span>久久滴水洞湘菜</span></p><span></span><p><span>谭姐湘菜</span></p><span></span><p><span>莲 湖北菜</span></p><span></span><p><span>盈田盈粥庄</span></p><span></span><p><span>清晨落叶江西菜</span></p><span></span><p><span>复旦周围的食堂：</span></p><span></span><p><span>三星麻辣烫</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/ltZQh3FmGrBjD9CbO_bY3ylIiIiU.m4a" length="72371127" type="audio/mp4"/>
